the next 1-8 hours (AUC 0.53-0.58 in 2019 and 2022), and the 24-hour fade predicts the next 8-24 hours (0.55-0.60). By 2025 the short fades are at 0.50-0.53 and only the 24-hour fade still holds (0.54-0.56). The hourly\u003cbr\u003eregression went from 0.58-0.59 (2019-20) to 0.54 (2024-25); its best single fade rule reaches 0.76-1.6 of the regression's edge. Data: Bitstamp BTC\u002fUSD 1-minute history (the cut file; not Binance).\u003c\u002fspan\u003e"},"height":980,"legend":{"orientation":"h","yanchor":"bottom","y":1.0483870967741935,"xanchor":"left","x":0.0},"margin":{"t":180,"b":56,"l":64,"r":24}}}